# mcp__sphinx_assess — sphinx/assess

Answer the pending SemanticAssessmentRequest. forms maps QuestionForm (Why/How/What/Who/Where/When/Which/Polar/Other) to belief mass; facets, targets and intents are optional.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  handle: string;
  /** QuestionForm → belief mass */
  forms: Record<string, number>;
  /** Facet → applicability */
  facets?: Record<string, number>;
  /** Target terms */
  targets?: string[];
  /** Intent terms */
  intents?: string[];
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://mcp__sphinx_assess.

