# mcp__sphinx_investigate — sphinx/investigate

Answer the pending InvestigateRequest. actionKey must be copied exactly from the current InvestigateRequest.action.id. Findings, evidence, hypotheses, candidates and semanticAssessment are optional collections; evidence must be explicit and sourced.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  handle: string;
  actionKey: string;
  /** Optional control-only semantic reassessment */
  semanticAssessment?: Record<string, unknown>;
  /** Findings with semanticKey and text */
  findings?: Record<string, unknown>[];
  /** Evidence with semanticKey, proposition, source, dependencyKey */
  evidence?: Record<string, unknown>[];
  /** Hypotheses with semanticKey and label */
  hypotheses?: Record<string, unknown>[];
  /** Follow-up candidate proposals */
  candidates?: Record<string, unknown>[];
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://mcp__sphinx_investigate.

