# mcp__sphinx_synthesize — sphinx/synthesize

Answer the pending SynthesizeRequest. Synthesis organizes existing findings; it does not create evidence. findingKeys must reference known findings.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  handle: string;
  text: string;
  /** Known finding keys organized by this synthesis */
  findingKeys?: string[];
  /** Explicit uncertainties */
  uncertainties?: string[];
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://mcp__sphinx_synthesize.

